  // Ported Low-Poly Ciomas Island Diorama & Articulated Smartphone (world.js)
// Low-Poly Rounded-Rectangle Ciomas Highland Farm Diorama & Articulated 3D Smartphone
// Built in Lemo-Opuscar lowpoly-island aesthetic: flat-shaded PBR facets, zero z-fighting,
